title: 'fix(beefy): submit equivocation reports through the offchain transaction pool'
doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: |-
    The BEEFY gadget submitted equivocation reports from a runtime API call with no offchain
    transaction pool registered, so `submit_transaction` panicked and no report was ever
    submitted. `BeefyParams` now takes an `offchain_tx_pool_factory`, as `GrandpaParams` does.
crates:
- name: sc-consensus-beefy
  bump: major
- name: sp-api-proc-macro
  bump: patch
- name: polkadot-service
  bump: patch
- name: staging-node-cli
  bump: patch
